
Description:
  Find graph nodes by exact identity, type, facet, or bounded text.

Usage:
  cis graph find [options]

Options:
  --repo <repo>        Repository path. Defaults to the current directory. [default: C:\miscwork\portfolio\cislib]
  --format <format>    Output format: human, json, or agent. [default: human]
  --id <id>            Exact full graph key or node-local ID.
  --kind <kind>        Exact node kind, such as component, reference-item, symbol, or test.
  --subtype <subtype>  Exact node subtype, such as api-operation, class, or xunit.
  --facet <facet>      Required node facet, such as contract, test, or dependency.
  --text <text>        Case-insensitive bounded text match over labels, IDs, and properties.
  --limit <limit>      Maximum result nodes, from 1 to 1000. [default: 20]
  -?, -h, --help       Show help and usage information

